          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.38.1+EXO.38.2+EXO.38.3+EXO.38.4+EXO.38.5+EXO.38.6+EXO.38.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ex 38.1-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “You shall make the altar of acacia wood, five cubits long and five cubits broad; the altar shall be square, and its height shall be three cubits. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And you shall make horns for it on its four corners; it horns shall be of one piece with it, and you shall overlay it with bronze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You shall make pots for it to receive its ashes, and shovels and basins and forks and firepans; all its utensils you shall make of bronze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You shall also make for it a grating, a network of bronze; and upon the net you shall make four bronze rings at its four corners. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And you shall set it under the ledge of the altar so that the net shall extend halfway down the altar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And you shall make poles for the altar, poles of acacia wood, and overlay them with bronze; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and the poles shall be put through the rings, so that the poles shall be upon the two sides of the altar, when it is carried. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You shall make it hollow, with boards; as it has been shown you on the mountain, so shall it be made.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
