                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “You shall make the court of the tabernacle. On the south side the court shall have hangings of fine twined linen a hundred cubits long for one side; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "their pillars shall be twenty and their bases twenty, of bronze, but the hooks of the pillars and their fillets shall be of silver. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And likewise for its length on the north side there shall be hangings a hundred cubits long, their pillars twenty and their bases twenty, of bronze, but the hooks of the pillars and their fillets shall be of silver. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And for the breadth of the court on the west side there shall be hangings for fifty cubits, with ten pillars and ten bases. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The breadth of the court on the front to the east shall be fifty cubits. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The hangings for the one side of the gate shall be fifteen cubits, with three pillars and three bases. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On the other side the hangings shall be fifteen cubits, with three pillars and three bases. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the gate of the court there shall be a screen twenty cubits long, of blue and purple and scarlet stuff and fine twined linen, embroidered with needlework; it shall have four pillars and with them four bases. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All the pillars around the court shall be filleted with silver; their hooks shall be of silver, and their bases of bronze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The length of the court shall be a hundred cubits, the breadth fifty, and the height five cubits, with hangings of fine twined linen and bases of bronze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All the utensils of the tabernacle for every use, and all its pegs and all the pegs of the court, shall be of bronze.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
